						 <p>Should the whole Pride Month thing be added to the History of the Universe? Maybe in a &quot;Part Six&quot;? That was a very big event in Foundation history because of the logo change, the LGBSCP video, the &quot;the site is runied&quot; and &quot;RIP&quot; stuff, the Twitter page becoming private, the time period where applying was disabled, the RPC Authority, the mods banning people by mistake, and another author deleting all of his SCPs and Tales and leaving the site for good!</p> 
