					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Personally I've become a bit weary of the name gag, but it reminds me a MUD that I used to code for. I wrote a &quot;voodoo doll of %name%&quot;, where &quot;%name%&quot; was replaced by the name of the character who was looking at it. I used to carry one with me, give them to random monsters or even just leave them laying around. It freaked out just about everyone. Good times. Good times.</p> 
				 	]]>
